{"id": "msg_a0d23669ccd445d8b966e666219850cf", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "截图对比已经表明：我的 3 列修复**确实生效**（新图已是 3 列），但测试圈出的空白属于**纵向行距**问题，与列数无关。原图行距依次为 39→41→45→58→77，逐行递增；新图行距依次为 39→54→70，也递增。递增规律指向**带图片的那一行把行高撑高**。接下来读布局实现确认："}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_669e7bcsxt5zwtd6jf4xp5oy", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "zhi2-web-admin/src/components/detail-template/detail-template.vue", "offset": 1, "limit": 130}}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:26:40.899Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
